window.LEARN_CONTENT=window.LEARN_CONTENT||{};window.LEARN_CONTENT["a-a62d553e55acddb6"]={"zh":"<p><a id=\"education\"></a></p> <h1 id=\"_1\">教育</h1> <blockquote> <p>如需查看完整文档索引，请参阅 <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt（需联网）</a>。将 <code>.md</code> 附加到页面 URL 后，可查看该页面的 Markdown 版本。</p> </blockquote> <p>将教学、学习和学术工作整理成可供审阅的成果。</p> <p>使用 ChatGPT Work 或 Codex，将分散的课程材料、学术要求、日程、反馈和项目背景整理成可编辑、可供审阅的工作成果。ChatGPT 可以保留来源证据、明确呈现不确定性，并由高校教职人员、中小学教师、学生和学校团队对学术与教学决策负责。</p> <p><a id=\"higher-education-faculty\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_2\">高等教育教师</h2> <p>更新课程、校准评估标准、比较不同班级、审阅学习参与情况、综合研究证据，并准备教师委员会决策材料。</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/refresh-course-materials\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">更新课程材料（本地尚未收录）</a>：使用 ChatGPT 配合 Google Drive 和文档工具，审阅教学大纲、幻灯片、阅读材料……</li> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/calibrate-assessments\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">校准评估标准（本地尚未收录）</a>：向 ChatGPT 提供去标识化的作业、评分标准、评分导出数据和反馈样例……</li> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/audit-course-section-consistency\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">审计不同班级课程的一致性（本地尚未收录）</a>：让 ChatGPT 比较不同班级的教学大纲、日程、作业、政策、LMS（学习管理系统）导出数据和……</li> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/track-course-engagement\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">跟踪课程参与度（本地尚未收录）</a>：使用 ChatGPT 处理 LMS 活动记录、成绩册、出勤记录、作业元数据和指标……</li> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/synthesize-research-evidence\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">综合研究证据（本地尚未收录）</a>：让 ChatGPT 综合论文、研究笔记、方法文档、以往提案……</li> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/prepare-committee-packet\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">准备委员会会议材料（本地尚未收录）</a>：使用 ChatGPT 汇总以往会议纪要、政策草案、相关方反馈和项目数据……</li> </ul> <p><a id=\"higher-education-students\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_3\">高等教育学生</h2> <p>规划一个学期、准备考试、协调学生项目、平衡时间和开支、搭建网站，并管理求职或实习申请。</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/organize-semester-workspace\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">整理学期工作区（本地尚未收录）</a>：使用 ChatGPT 处理课程文件夹、教学大纲、作业说明、阅读材料、笔记和日历……</li> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/build-exam-study-system\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">搭建考试学习系统（本地尚未收录）</a>：使用 ChatGPT 处理学习目标、笔记、阅读材料、习题、以往测验和考试……</li> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/run-student-club-project\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">开展学生社团项目（本地尚未收录）</a>：使用 ChatGPT 处理项目简介、共享文件夹、会议记录、预算和成员空闲时间……</li> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/plan-budget-and-schedule\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">规划预算与日程（本地尚未收录）</a>：使用 ChatGPT 汇总课程日历、工作班次、周期性安排、收入和支出……</li> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/build-student-website\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">搭建学生网站（本地尚未收录）</a>：使用 Sites 根据学生项目内容、设计要求等界定范围、构建并测试一个简单网站……</li> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/track-job-applications\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">跟踪求职申请（本地尚未收录）</a>：使用 ChatGPT 汇总经过核实的经历说明、简历、作品集和职位描述……</li> </ul> <p><a id=\"k12-teachers\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"k12\">K–12 教师</h2> <p>整理教学文件、规划教学单元、创建课堂演示文稿及配套材料、将反馈一致地应用到相关材料中，并构建互动式教学资源。</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/organize-lesson-unit-folder\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">整理课程或教学单元文件夹（本地尚未收录）</a>：使用 ChatGPT 检查现有课程或教学单元文件夹，识别重复项并提出实用的整理……</li> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/build-unit-plan-from-sources\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">根据源文件制定教学单元计划（本地尚未收录）</a>：使用 ChatGPT 汇总教学标准、课程指南、以往课程文件和校历……</li> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/create-lesson-deck\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">创建课堂演示文稿（本地尚未收录）</a>：使用经过审阅的教学单元计划、以往幻灯片或笔记、学区模板和经批准的……</li> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/create-classroom-materials-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">创建课堂材料包（本地尚未收录）</a>：使用经过审阅的课堂演示文稿、教学单元计划、学校指南、讲义和……</li> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/revise-lesson-package\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">修订教学材料包（本地尚未收录）</a>：使用当前课程文件夹、书面或口述反馈、经批准的文件和……</li> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/build-interactive-lesson-resource\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">构建互动式教学资源（本地尚未收录）</a>：使用 Sites 配合经批准的教学材料、练习题、反馈规则和无障碍要求……</li> </ul>","en":"<h1 id=\"education\">Education</h1> <blockquote> <p>For the complete documentation index, see <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt (online)</a>. Markdown versions of documentation pages are available by appending <code>.md</code> to the page URL.</p> </blockquote> <p>Turn teaching, learning, and academic work into review-ready artifacts.</p> <p>Use ChatGPT Work or Codex to turn distributed course materials, academic requirements, schedules, feedback, and project context into editable, review-ready work. ChatGPT can preserve source evidence, make uncertainty visible, and keep faculty, teachers, students, and school teams responsible for academic and instructional decisions.</p> <h2 id=\"higher-education-faculty\">Higher education faculty</h2> <p>Refresh courses, calibrate assessments, compare sections, review engagement, synthesize research evidence, and prepare faculty committee decisions.</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/refresh-course-materials\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Refresh course materials (not in this local snapshot)</a>: Use ChatGPT with Google Drive and document tools to review syllabi, slides, readings...</li> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/calibrate-assessments\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Calibrate assessments (not in this local snapshot)</a>: Use ChatGPT with de-identified submissions, rubrics, grading exports, and sample feedback to...</li> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/audit-course-section-consistency\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Audit course section consistency (not in this local snapshot)</a>: Use ChatGPT to compare section syllabi, schedules, assignments, policies, LMS exports, and...</li> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/track-course-engagement\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Track course engagement (not in this local snapshot)</a>: Use ChatGPT with LMS activity, gradebook, attendance, assignment metadata, and metric...</li> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/synthesize-research-evidence\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Synthesize research evidence (not in this local snapshot)</a>: Use ChatGPT to synthesize papers, research notes, methods documents, prior proposals...</li> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/prepare-committee-packet\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Prepare a committee packet (not in this local snapshot)</a>: Use ChatGPT with prior minutes, policy drafts, stakeholder feedback, program data...</li> </ul> <h2 id=\"higher-education-students\">Higher education students</h2> <p>Organize a semester, prepare for exams, coordinate student projects, balance time and money, build a website, and manage job or internship applications.</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/organize-semester-workspace\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Organize a semester workspace (not in this local snapshot)</a>: Use ChatGPT with course folders, syllabi, assignment sheets, readings, notes, and calendar...</li> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/build-exam-study-system\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Build an exam study system (not in this local snapshot)</a>: Use ChatGPT with learning objectives, notes, readings, problem sets, prior quizzes, exam...</li> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/run-student-club-project\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Run a student club project (not in this local snapshot)</a>: Use ChatGPT with a project brief, shared folder, meeting notes, budget, member availability...</li> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/plan-budget-and-schedule\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Plan a budget and schedule (not in this local snapshot)</a>: Use ChatGPT with course calendars, work shifts, recurring commitments, income, expenses, and...</li> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/build-student-website\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Build a student website (not in this local snapshot)</a>: Use Sites to scope, build, and test a simple website from student project content, design...</li> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/track-job-applications\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Track job applications (not in this local snapshot)</a>: Use ChatGPT with verified experience notes, a resume, portfolio, role descriptions, career...</li> </ul> <h2 id=\"k12-teachers\">K–12 teachers</h2> <p>Organize teaching files, plan units, create lesson decks and companion materials, apply feedback consistently, and build interactive lesson resources.</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/organize-lesson-unit-folder\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Organize a lesson or unit folder (not in this local snapshot)</a>: Use ChatGPT with an existing lesson or unit folder to identify duplicates, propose practical...</li> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/build-unit-plan-from-sources\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Build a unit plan from source files (not in this local snapshot)</a>: Use ChatGPT with standards, curriculum guidance, prior lesson files, a school calendar...</li> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/create-lesson-deck\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Create a lesson deck (not in this local snapshot)</a>: Use ChatGPT with a reviewed unit plan, prior slides or notes, a district template, approved...</li> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/create-classroom-materials-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Create a classroom materials pack (not in this local snapshot)</a>: Use ChatGPT with a reviewed lesson deck, unit plan, school guidance, handouts, and...</li> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/revise-lesson-package\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Revise a lesson package (not in this local snapshot)</a>: Use ChatGPT with a current lesson folder, written or dictated feedback, approved files, and...</li> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/build-interactive-lesson-resource\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Build an interactive lesson resource (not in this local snapshot)</a>: Use Sites with approved lesson materials, practice questions, feedback rules, accessibility...</li> </ul>"};
